[![20121011\_-\_keyim\_ba\_basement\_-\_0058(1)](/media/2013/09/20121011_-_keyim_ba_basement_-_00581.jpg)](/?attachment_id=4514)The Sunshine Coast Regional Council has jumped on the rhythm scene with African drumming and dancing workshops with Keyim Ba at The J in Noosa. These workshops will be held from 12pm on Saturday 14th Sepetmber with a showcase of Keyim Ba in performance! Not to be missed! The Sunshine Coast council has given all Rhythm Culture friends 50% off all workshop prices, making these workshops $10 each!  email: info@rhythmculture.com.au for more info on how to get your tickets!
